3D Interactive Framework
Copyright 2026 FreakingPotato and contributors
https://github.com/FreakingPotato/3D_Interactive_Framework

A browser-based framework starter for interactive 3D exploration, local hand
tracking, timeline navigation and procedural sonification. The whole-cell
examples are applications of the framework, not models developed by this project.

